  "question": "Which fast food restaurant are located within 100 kilometers on the route connecting Memory Garden, Baltimore, MD and Hotel Monaco Baltimore, Baltimore, MD?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.638575 39.300016)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.615395 39.289811)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.638575 39.300016)',4326)::geography, 100000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.638575 39.300016)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
